{"id":"dbeebd3188fb9a4d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz.md","title":"S4 Grz","display":"df-modal-logic-s4-grz — S4 Grz","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz","aliases":["89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz"],"display":"df-modal-logic-s4-grz — S4 Grz","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-logic-s4-grz — S4 Grz"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}s4\\text{-}grz}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal{A}_{G}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(\\Box(A\\to\\Box A)\\to A)\\to A\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{S4Grz}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{S4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{G}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}\n\\end{gathered}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}s4\\text{-}grz}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal{A}_{G}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(\\Box(A\\to\\Box A)\\to A)\\to A\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{S4Grz}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{S4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{G}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}\n\\end{gathered}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4Grz}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4Grz}\\)</span> : S4Grzegorczyk逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\)</span> : 自反传递模态逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a>)</li>\n<li>Grz 对应有限自反、传递且反对称的框架；仅自反传递不足。</li>\n<li>它的算术解释使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span>（可证并且该句子成立）的递归翻译，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"283c19abd035c9ac\" href=\"?note=283c19abd035c9ac\" title=\"89-thm-grz-translation\">89-thm-grz-translation</a>。普通可证明性解释下的总为真逻辑是 GLS。</li>\n<li>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 12 章，印刷页 155–164；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{S4}$ : 自反传递模态逻辑 (see [[89-df-modal-logic-s4]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-grz-translation","status":"resolved","id":"283c19abd035c9ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"它的算术解释使用 $\\Box^+$（可证并且该句子成立）的递归翻译，见 [[89-thm-grz-translation]]。普通可证明性解释下的总为真逻辑是 GLS。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}s4\\text{-}grz}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal{A}_{G}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(\\Box(A\\to\\Box A)\\to A)\\to A\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{S4Grz}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{S4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{G}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}\n\\end{gathered}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4Grz}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"e67bc8e485daa168","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{S4Grz}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz]])."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-371","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-s4-grz]]"}],"outgoing":["64bdfb29fd90b6b0","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","32c9990061b9749d","283c19abd035c9ac"]}